description:
South Kesteven District Council wishes to invite tenders for the supply of Goods and Works concerning two specific projects, where the bidder must deliver both requirements.  These include:

Ramp Installation and Footpath Upgrade Works at Lollycocks Field, Sleaford. A specialist contractor is required to deliver ramp installation, footpath upgrade, fence and gate installation, and; 

Footpath Upgrade works alongside the River Slea from NGR TF 0591945946 to TF 0557445899, Sleaford. A specialist contractor is required to deliver these works.
